from ground_author import *
add('b177','大直徑豎井的切削、出碴與支護產能平衡~Balancing cutting, muck removal and support in large shafts','大直徑豎井的進度由完整作業循環決定，不能只看切削機額定功率。本課把幾何開挖量、切削能、提升循環、工作盤反力與通風排水聯成系統，利用量測分辨設備瓶頸與地層限制，並以故障停機及永久襯砌介面建立可追溯的施工交接。~Large-shaft progress depends on the complete operating cycle rather than rated cutting power. The course links excavation volume, cutting energy, hoisting cycles, working-platform reactions, ventilation and drainage, uses measurements to separate equipment bottlenecks from ground constraints, and develops traceable handover through downtime and permanent-lining interfaces.',compact(r'''
開挖斷面~Excavation section || 大直徑井每增加少量直徑，單位深度的開挖體積便按平方增加；出碴、襯砌與設備空間也隨之改變。名目井徑不是實際開挖輪廓，超挖及地層掉塊必須另外計量，才可建立可靠的物料平衡與施工循環。~Even a small diameter increase raises excavation volume per unit depth quadratically, affecting muck handling, lining and equipment space. Nominal shaft diameter is not the excavated profile; overbreak and falling blocks must be measured separately to establish a credible material balance and cycle. || 直徑D=10 m、進尺h=1 m，原位體積V=πD²h/4=78.54 m³~For diameter D=10 m and advance h=1 m, in-situ volume V=πD²h/4=78.54 m³ || 掃描各段斷面並核對標高，將原位體積與提升容器計量分列，使用實測鬆方係數比較。~Scan each lift and check elevations; distinguish in-situ volume from hoisted loose volume and compare them using a measured bulking factor. || 把鬆方當原位方會誤判出碴效率，亦可能掩蓋局部超挖與井壁鬆動。~Confusing loose and in-situ volume distorts mucking efficiency and can conceal overbreak or shaft-wall loosening. || 井徑增加百分之十，開挖體積也只增加百分之十。~A ten-percent diameter increase produces only ten-percent more excavation volume. || 物料表須保留井深、掃描輪廓及體積定義，超挖量應交地工設計者判讀後調整支護。~Retain depth, scanned profile and volume definitions in material records; the geotechnical designer reviews overbreak before support is revised. || 幾何計算不預測切削難度，也不能把破碎岩塊的鬆方直接當作地層流失；比較產量前須先統一體積基準與計量位置。~Geometry does not predict cuttability, and loose broken rock is not automatically ground loss; normalize the volume basis and measurement location before comparing production.
切削比能~Cutting specific energy || 切削比能把破岩所需能量與開挖體積連結，可用來比較同一設備在不同岩層中的反應。刀具磨耗、岩石強度、節理和切入深度都會改變比能；額定電功率另含傳動損失，不能全部當成有效破岩功率。~Specific cutting energy links rock-breaking energy to excavated volume and helps compare one machine across strata. Tool wear, rock strength, joints and penetration change the energy demand. Rated electrical power also includes drivetrain losses and therefore cannot all be assigned to useful rock breakage. || 有效比能e=20 MJ/m³、原位切削率Q=0.02 m³/s，P=eQ=0.4 MW=400 kW~For useful specific energy e=20 MJ/m³ and in-situ cutting rate Q=0.02 m³/s, P=eQ=0.4 MW=400 kW || 同步記錄功率、扭矩、切入量與原位方量，剔除空轉時段後比較不同地層的比能。~Synchronize power, torque, penetration and in-situ volume, excluding idle periods before comparing specific energy between strata. || 刀具磨鈍仍追求固定進尺會使熱與扭矩升高，造成異常磨損或頻繁跳機。~Maintaining fixed advance with blunt tools increases heat and torque, producing abnormal wear or frequent trips. || 切削機額定功率越大就一定有同比例的進尺。~Higher rated cutting power always gives proportionally higher advance. || 機械與地質紀錄應用同一時間戳；功率偏離基準時先查刀具及地層，再由設備負責人核定調整。~Use one clock for mechanical and geological logs; investigate tools and ground before the equipment lead approves changes following power deviations. || 比能是狀態指標而非可通用的材料常數，必須注明量測位於馬達端或刀盤端，並保留效率與空轉扣除的方法。~Specific energy is a condition indicator rather than a universal material constant; identify whether measurement is at motor or cutter and document efficiency and idle-power corrections.
提升循環~Hoisting cycle || 井底破岩後仍須把碴土送至地面，提升能力常隨井深增加而下降。完整循環包含裝載、加速、運送、卸載與回程，容器額定容量若未滿載或受限於重量便不能直接當有效體積。設備之間的等候時間也會消耗可用產能。~Broken rock must still reach the surface, and hoisting capacity often falls as shaft depth increases. The full cycle includes loading, acceleration, travel, unloading and return. Rated bucket volume is not useful volume when fill is incomplete or weight governs, while waiting between subsystems consumes available capacity. || 假設每循環有效鬆方Vb=8 m³、完整循環t=240 s，Qh=Vb×3600/t=120 m³/h~With useful loose volume Vb=8 m³ and full cycle t=240 s, hoisting rate Qh=Vb×3600/t=120 m³/h || 用事件紀錄拆解各循環時間，抽核容器重量與密度；將平均及長尾等候時間分別呈現。~Break cycles into event times and sample bucket mass and density; report average times and long waiting tails separately. || 忽略裝卸或停等會高估產能，井底堆碴後可能妨礙逃生與支護作業空間。~Ignoring loading or waiting overstates capacity; accumulated muck can obstruct escape and support-working space at the shaft bottom. || 提升速度與容器容量足以單獨決定實際日產量。~Hoisting speed and bucket capacity alone determine actual daily production. || 施工排程應列有效容器量及完整循環分布；碴量接近工作空間上限時，由施工負責人啟動排程停留點。~Schedule with useful bucket volume and full-cycle distributions; the construction lead activates a hold point when muck approaches the working-space limit. || 此處是鬆方提升量，與切削原位量比較時要換算；雙容器或交錯作業會改變循環邏輯，不能直接相加額定值。~This is loose-volume hoisting capacity and requires conversion before comparison with in-situ cutting; twin-bucket or overlapping operations change cycle logic, so ratings cannot simply be added.
工作盤支承~Working-platform supports || 工作盤承載人員、機具及材料，反力經支承裝置傳入井壁或懸吊系統。理想對稱分配僅能作初步估算，設備偏心、支點高差與局部剛度不同會使個別支點受力超過平均值；臨時構件的負載也隨施工階段改變。~The working platform carries personnel, machinery and materials, transferring reactions into the shaft wall or suspension system. Equal sharing is only an initial estimate: equipment eccentricity, support-level errors and stiffness differences can overload one support above the average, and temporary-member loads change with construction stage. || 假設總垂直荷重W=800 kN、4個相同且對稱支點，平均R=W/4=200 kN/支點~For total vertical load W=800 kN and four identical symmetric supports, mean reaction R=W/4=200 kN per support || 核對設備重心、支點標高與反力計，將實測反力總和及力矩與荷重清單比較。~Check equipment centres of gravity, support elevations and load cells; compare the measured reaction sum and moment with the load inventory. || 一個支點失去接觸會使荷重轉移，造成局部壓碎或盤面傾斜，而總重量並未改變。~Loss of contact at one support redistributes load, causing local crushing or platform tilt even though total weight is unchanged. || 四個支點在所有工況下必定各承受四分之一重量。~Four supports necessarily carry one quarter of the load in every condition. || 設備移位與增加材料堆置須更新荷重圖；臨時工程設計者應審查偏心及支點失效情境再放行。~Update load maps when equipment or stockpiles move; the temporary-works designer reviews eccentricity and support-loss cases before release. || 平均反力不是支點設計上限；實際檢核還須含偏心、動態作用與支承局部承壓，並確認井壁有足夠的傳力範圍。~The mean reaction is not a design maximum; actual checks include eccentricity, dynamics and local bearing, with adequate shaft-wall area to transfer the force.
垂直導向~Vertical alignment || 深井的微小方向誤差會隨深度累積為顯著偏移，影響設備間隙、襯砌厚度與後續永久設施。井口控制點若移動，單一雷射可能顯示穩定卻整體偏離，因此導向需要獨立測量網與分段閉合檢核，而非只觀察機械姿態。~Small directional error accumulates into substantial offset with depth, affecting equipment clearance, lining thickness and permanent installations. If a collar control point moves, one laser may appear stable while the entire alignment drifts. Guidance therefore needs an independent survey network and staged closure checks, not machinery attitude alone. || 深度L=300 m、假設恆定小角誤差θ=0.001 rad，偏移δ≈Lθ=0.30 m~For depth L=300 m and constant small angular error θ=0.001 rad, offset δ≈Lθ=0.30 m || 以獨立基準複測井口控制點，分深度比對雷射、垂線與斷面掃描，辨別基準漂移及真實偏斜。~Resurvey collar control independently and compare laser, plumb and scanned profiles by depth to distinguish datum movement from real inclination. || 基準點漂移或儀器偏心會使井道逐步偏離，直到設備與襯砌間隙不足才顯現問題。~Control movement or instrument eccentricity can progressively misalign the shaft until equipment-to-lining clearance becomes insufficient. || 導向儀顯示垂直就不需要獨立測量複核。~A vertical guidance display removes the need for independent survey checks. || 每次控制點改設均保留前後轉換及閉合誤差；測量負責人確認後，才更新施工設備的導向座標。~Retain transformations and closure errors whenever control is changed; the survey lead confirms them before machine guidance coordinates are updated. || 小角線性式只描述固定角誤差；真實曲線偏移應沿深度積分，且不同方向的誤差可能抵銷或疊加，不能只看最後井底點。~The linear approximation describes constant angular error only; real curved deviation requires integration with depth, and directional errors can cancel or accumulate, so the final bottom point is insufficient.
支護落後距~Support lag || 切削面與已完成支護之間的距離代表裸露井壁的空間與時間，不能只用每日進尺判斷穩定。節理、地下水與風化控制自立時間，支護施工慢於破岩時，落後距會逐步增加，令原先合理的工序變成新的不利暴露條件。~The distance between excavation and completed support represents both exposed-wall length and exposure time; daily advance alone cannot establish stability. Joints, groundwater and weathering govern stand-up behaviour. When support progresses slower than cutting, lag grows and a previously acceptable sequence develops a new adverse exposure condition. || 假設等速進尺v=0.4 m/h，支護完成延遲t=5 h，裸露長度L=vt=2 m~At constant advance v=0.4 m/h and support delay t=5 h, exposed length L=vt=2 m || 將開挖時間、支護完成深度與地質分區畫在同一圖，記錄掉塊及位移是否集中在落後段。~Plot excavation time, completed-support depth and geology together, noting whether block falls and movements concentrate within the lag zone. || 落後距增加可能誘發楔塊掉落，延誤支護又會進一步擴大暴露，形成惡性循環。~Increasing lag can trigger wedge falls; the resulting support delay further enlarges exposure and creates a reinforcing deterioration cycle. || 只要最終支護足夠厚，施工中裸露長度就不重要。~Adequate final support thickness makes temporary exposed length unimportant. || 設計者應按地層訂定落後距與時間的停留點；變更進尺速度前，要同時確認支護人力、設備與材料能力。~The designer specifies lag-distance and exposure-time hold points by geology; changing advance requires simultaneous confirmation of support labour, equipment and material capacity. || 此算例不是允許的裸露長度，亦未包含開挖擾動；穩定評估需結合節理幾何與觀測趨勢，不可用產能公式替代岩體分析。~This is not an allowable exposure length and excludes excavation disturbance; stability requires joint geometry and observed trends, not a production equation substituted for rock-mass analysis.
通風流量~Ventilation flow || 豎井通風須把新鮮空氣送到實際作業位置，再形成可辨識的回流路徑。管內平均速度與截面積決定風量，但漏風、短路循環和局部死角會使作業區的有效換氣低於管路量測，深度增加也會增加沿程壓損。~Shaft ventilation must deliver fresh air to the actual work location and establish a recognizable return path. Mean duct velocity and area determine flow, but leakage, recirculation short circuits and stagnant pockets can reduce effective workplace exchange below the duct measurement, while greater depth increases friction losses. || 假設平均管速v=10 m/s、有效截面A=0.8 m²，Q=vA=8 m³/s~With mean duct velocity v=10 m/s and effective area A=0.8 m², Q=vA=8 m³/s || 以風速剖面量測取得平均值，並在進風、工作區與回風測氣體及粉塵，辨別循環短路。~Measure a velocity traverse for the mean and sample gases and dust at intake, workplace and return to identify recirculation short circuits. || 風管流量合格仍可能因漏風或回流造成局部污染物累積，單點風速讀值會掩蓋死角。~An acceptable duct flow can coexist with local contaminant buildup from leakage or recirculation; one velocity reading may conceal stagnant zones. || 風管測得足夠流量就能保證每個作業點的空氣品質。~Adequate measured duct flow guarantees air quality at every work location. || 通風設計者需核准作業區量測位置及改管後驗證；任何風管延伸或工作盤配置變更都應重查有效換氣。~The ventilation designer approves workplace sampling and post-modification verification; extending ducts or changing platform layout requires reassessment of effective air exchange. || 體積流量不等於污染物控制標準；還須依污染源、設備排放與當地規範核定需求，本課數值不是作業許可。~Volumetric flow is not a contaminant-control criterion; demand also depends on sources, equipment emissions and local requirements, and this example does not authorize operations.
湧水緩衝~Water inflow buffer || 井底集水與排水系統必須在湧水變動及設備停機期間保持可用空間。平均湧水量只能估算短時累積，裂隙連通或承壓層突破會使流量突然改變；泵浦曲線、排放背壓與備援供電共同決定可排出的實際水量。~Sump and pumping systems must preserve working space during changing inflow and equipment outages. Mean inflow estimates short-term accumulation only; connected fractures or penetration of a pressurized aquifer can change flow abruptly. Pump curves, discharge backpressure and backup power jointly determine actual removal rather than nameplate capacity alone. || 假設停泵期間恆定流入Q=0.06 m³/s、停機t=600 s，新增水量V=Qt=36 m³~For constant inflow Q=0.06 m³/s during an outage t=600 s, accumulated volume V=Qt=36 m³ || 以流量計、水位計及泵浦運轉紀錄建立入出水平衡，測試訊號失效與備援切換的可辨識性。~Use flow, level and pump logs for a water balance, checking whether signal failure and backup transfer remain detectable. || 集水容積不足或備援不能啟動會使水位淹及設備，並改變井底穩定與撤離條件。~Insufficient sump storage or failed backup raises water over equipment and changes bottom stability and evacuation conditions. || 排水泵額定流量大於平均湧水量就沒有停機風險。~Pump nameplate capacity above average inflow eliminates outage risk. || 湧水增加與液位上升應有獨立警報；備援能力及停留點由排水、地工與施工負責人共同核定。~Provide independent inflow and level alarms; drainage, geotechnical and construction leads jointly approve backup capability and operational hold points. || 這是固定流量的儲水量估算，不包含突湧峰值或自由空間損失；容量分析必須扣除沉積物、泵浦與不可用高度。~This fixed-flow storage estimate excludes surge inflow and lost free space; capacity analysis must subtract sediment, equipment displacement and unusable depth.
設備可用率~Equipment availability || 機械可用率描述設備具備運轉能力的時間比例，不能與實際利用率或工地進尺混為一談。預防維護可能短時降低排程可用時間，卻減少重大故障；等待支護、通風或材料則屬系統協調問題，應與設備自身故障分開編碼。~Mechanical availability describes the fraction of time equipment is capable of operating, not utilization or achieved advance. Preventive maintenance can reduce scheduled available time temporarily while avoiding major failures. Waiting for support, ventilation or supplies belongs to system coordination and should be coded separately from intrinsic machinery failure. || 假設平均運轉至故障MTBF=80 h、平均修復MTTR=8 h，A=MTBF/(MTBF+MTTR)=0.909~With mean time between failures MTBF=80 h and mean repair time MTTR=8 h, A=MTBF/(MTBF+MTTR)=0.909 || 將故障、預防維護及等待時間分開記錄，抽查修復起迄定義，避免把排隊等料當成機械故障。~Separate failures, preventive maintenance and waiting, auditing repair start and finish definitions so that supply queues are not mislabeled as machinery faults. || 混淆停機原因會把資源投在錯誤瓶頸，備件不足又可能使少見故障產生很長的停機尾端。~Confused downtime causes direct resources toward the wrong bottleneck; inadequate spares can give rare faults exceptionally long repair tails. || 設備可用率百分之九十就代表日進尺達理論值九成。~Ninety-percent availability means daily advance reaches ninety percent of its theoretical value. || 交接維護資料要含故障模式、備件位置與修復時間分布；設備負責人按關鍵故障影響核定備援，而非只看平均率。~Handover maintenance records include failure modes, spare locations and repair-time distributions; the equipment lead selects redundancy from critical consequences rather than the average rate alone. || 此可用率式假設長期穩態且故障修復定義一致；它不包含計畫休班、施工等待或地層限制，不能直接作為工程進度保證。~The expression assumes a long-run steady state and consistent failure-repair definitions; it excludes planned shifts, construction waiting and ground limits and therefore cannot guarantee project progress.
系統瓶頸~System bottleneck || 串聯施工系統中最慢的必要工序限制穩態產量，暫存空間只能吸收短時波動，不能永久消除瓶頸。提升能力充足但支護落後時，加快切削只會增加井底堆積與裸露時間；改良一個工序後，限制也可能轉移到另一環節。~In a serial construction system, the slowest required process limits steady throughput; buffers absorb short fluctuations but cannot remove a permanent bottleneck. If support lags despite adequate hoisting, faster cutting merely increases bottom accumulation and exposure. Improving one activity can transfer the constraint to another subsystem, so interventions must be assessed across the complete cycle. || 全部換成原位等值後，切削90、提升120、支護70 m³/h，理想穩態Q=min(90,120,70)=70 m³/h~On one in-situ-equivalent basis, cutting, hoisting and support capacities are 90, 120 and 70 m³/h; ideal steady Q=min(90,120,70)=70 m³/h || 對齊工序時間戳與體積基準，追蹤排隊長度、暫存量及支護完成深度，確認最慢環節是否持續存在。~Align activity clocks and volume bases, then track queues, buffer volumes and completed-support depth to determine whether the apparent bottleneck persists. || 只購置更大切削設備可能增加成本而不增加產量，並讓支護與排水超出原先協調能力。~A larger cutter alone may increase cost without improving throughput while overloading the planned support and drainage coordination. || 每個工序的額定產量相加就是整體施工產量。~Adding the rated capacities of all activities gives system throughput. || 日報應把各工序等值產量與等待原因並列；任何增產方案由施工及臨時工程設計者共同審查支護與緩衝容量。~Daily reports show equivalent activity outputs beside waiting causes; construction and temporary-works leads jointly review support and buffer capacity for any production increase. || 最小值模型適用於簡化串聯系統，實際並行工序、變異與停機會降低達成值；不得把理想瓶頸產能當作現場承諾。~The minimum model applies to a simplified serial system; parallel activities, variability and outages affect achieved output, so ideal bottleneck capacity is not a field commitment.
'''),'原創教學例：圓井直徑D=10 m，每次進尺h=1 m，原位體積為V=πD²h/4=78.54 m³。若直徑增加10%至11 m而進尺相同，V=π×11²×1/4=95.03 m³，增加21%。提升量若以鬆方記錄，必須先以實測鬆方係數換算，才可與此原位量比較。這項幾何敏感度不表示切削時間必然增加21%，因為岩性、刀具、出碴及支護還可能改變循環。施工團隊應把新增體積放入整個循環分析，而非只擴大切削功率。~Original teaching example: for a circular shaft with D=10 m and advance h=1 m, in-situ volume is V=πD²h/4=78.54 m³. Increasing diameter by 10% to 11 m at the same advance gives V=π×11²×1/4=95.03 m³, an increase of 21%. Hoisted loose volume must first be converted using a measured bulking factor before comparison. This geometric sensitivity does not imply exactly 21% more cutting time because geology, tools, muck handling and support also shape the cycle. The construction team should insert the extra volume into the complete cycle model instead of simply increasing the installed cutting power alone.',['herrenknecht-jansen','herrenknecht-sbr','dmc-sbr','geo-site'],['詹森礦井豎井~Jansen Mine shafts','涅任斯基礦井：設備系統比較~Nezhinsky Mine: machine-system comparison'])

add('b178','岩洞穹頂的節理楔塊、岩拱與複合支護~Cavern-crown joint wedges, rock arching and composite support','大跨度岩洞的穩定同時受到節理幾何、開挖卸載、支護剛度及三維交叉口影響。本課分開討論可脫落楔塊與整體岩體拱效應，讓學徒用力學模型、應變監測及反算辨別真正的荷載路徑，再檢查地震與排水退化如何改變既有支護的需求。~Large-span cavern stability depends on joints, excavation unloading, support stiffness and three-dimensional intersections. This course distinguishes detachable wedges from rock-mass arching, uses force models, strain monitoring and back-analysis to identify load paths, and evaluates how seismic action and drainage deterioration change support demand.',compact(r'''
節理楔塊~Joint wedge || 岩洞穹頂的節理組合可能界定一塊能向洞內移動的岩塊，即使完整岩石強度很高也不保證穩定。楔塊是否形成取決於節理傾向、傾角及延續性，不能只從單一剖面推斷；重量則是滑移或掉落分析的基本荷載。~Intersecting joints may define a block capable of moving into the cavern even when intact rock is strong. Formation depends on joint dip, direction and persistence and cannot be inferred from one section alone. Block weight is the basic load for a sliding or falling mechanism. || 岩石單位重γ=26 kN/m³、假設楔塊體積V=12 m³，W=γV=312 kN~With rock unit weight γ=26 kN/m³ and assumed wedge volume V=12 m³, W=γV=312 kN || 用掌子面與穹頂測繪建立三維節理面，對可能出露的塊體核對延續性與體積，不把所有交線當真實裂面。~Build three-dimensional joint planes from face and crown mapping, verifying persistence and volume of potentially daylighting blocks rather than treating every intersection as a real release surface. || 節理延續性低估會漏掉大楔塊，局部落石常是幾何失穩的先兆，不能以平均岩體評分忽略。~Underestimated persistence can miss a large wedge; local falls may precede geometric instability and must not be dismissed using an average rock-mass rating. || 完整岩石抗壓強度很高就不會有穹頂落塊。~High intact-rock compressive strength prevents cavern-crown block falls. || 地質模型應保留節理可信度及未曝光區；開挖暴露新節理後，由地工設計者重核楔塊支護需求。~Retain joint-confidence levels and unexposed areas in the geological model; the geotechnical designer reassesses wedge support when new joints are exposed. || 重量計算不包含節理剪力、地下水與支護反力，亦不等於所需錨力；先證明可動方向，再建立相應自由體圖。~Weight alone excludes joint shear, water and support reactions and is not the required anchor force; establish admissible movement before drawing the corresponding free body.
岩拱應力~Rock-arch stress || 地下開挖把原先穿越洞室的應力重新分配到穹頂與側牆，岩體可形成拱狀傳力，但拱腳必須有足夠拘束。上覆地層重量提供初始應力量級，實際水平應力及構造作用則可能主導局部壓碎、剝落或高側牆變形。~Excavation redirects stresses that previously crossed the cavern into the crown and sidewalls, allowing arch-like transfer only if the abutments retain confinement. Overburden weight gives an initial stress scale, while horizontal and tectonic stresses may govern local crushing, spalling or tall-wall deformation. || 假設均質覆岩γ=26 kN/m³、深度H=100 m，垂直應力σv=γH=2600 kPa=2.6 MPa~For homogeneous overburden γ=26 kN/m³ and depth H=100 m, vertical stress σv=γH=2600 kPa=2.6 MPa || 對照覆岩地形與原位應力量測，追蹤穹頂及側牆收斂方向，檢查數值模型的拱腳反力位置。~Compare overburden topography and in-situ stress measurements, track crown and sidewall convergence directions, and inspect arch-abutment reactions in the numerical model. || 側牆卸載破壞拱腳拘束時，穹頂支護需求會增加；單看拱頂位移小可能漏掉側向失穩。~Sidewall unloading can weaken arch confinement and increase crown-support demand; small crown movement alone may conceal a developing lateral instability. || 上覆岩重全部直接落在噴凝土薄殼上。~All overburden weight acts directly on the thin shotcrete shell. || 分層開挖方案須同時檢查穹頂及拱腳，不可只更新拱頂斷面；側牆開挖停留點由岩洞設計者確認。~Stage analysis must update both crown and abutments, not only the roof section; the cavern designer confirms hold points for sidewall excavation. || 覆岩公式不是岩拱解析解，無法單獨預測洞周集中應力；地形、節理各向異性及施工卸載都須另行納入。~The overburden expression is not an arch solution and cannot predict boundary stress concentrations alone; topography, joint anisotropy and staged unloading require separate treatment.
跨度效應~Span effect || 增加岩洞跨度會增加支護跨越弱區的需求，也改變節理楔塊可形成的尺寸。均布荷載簡支梁的平方尺度可提醒跨度敏感度，但岩洞不是自由梁，實際承載由岩體、噴凝土及錨索共同提供，不能把梁式直接當岩洞設計公式。~Greater cavern span increases the distance support must bridge across weak ground and changes possible wedge dimensions. The squared-span scaling of a uniformly loaded simple beam illustrates sensitivity, but a cavern is not a free beam: rock, shotcrete and anchors share resistance, so the beam relation is not a cavern design equation. || 僅作等載重簡支梁比較，L₁=18 m、L₂=24 m，M₂/M₁=(L₂/L₁)²=(24/18)²=1.78~Only for equal-load simple-beam comparison, L₁=18 m and L₂=24 m give M₂/M₁=(L₂/L₁)²=(24/18)²=1.78 || 比較各跨度方案的地質暴露、楔塊幾何與支護位移，使用同一材料及邊界條件檢查敏感度。~Compare geological exposure, wedge geometry and support displacement across span alternatives, keeping material and boundary assumptions consistent in the sensitivity study. || 把較小岩洞的支護間距原封不動放大使用，可能造成未支承塊體尺寸增加與局部超載。~Reusing small-cavern support spacing unchanged for a larger cavern may increase unsupported block size and local demand. || 洞室跨度變大時，只按跨度比例增加支護即可。~Support only needs to increase linearly with cavern span. || 方案比較應把模型形式與不變參數列清楚；結構及地工設計者共同確認何時必須改採三維岩體分析。~State model form and fixed parameters in option comparisons; structural and geotechnical designers jointly decide when three-dimensional rock analysis becomes necessary. || 這個比值只對假設的梁系統成立，並非任何實際岩洞的承載力比例；尺寸放大還可能改變節理機制與施工方法。~The ratio applies only to the assumed beam system, not the resistance of an actual cavern; scaling geometry can also change joint mechanisms and construction methods.
錨索分力~Cable support component || 穹頂錨索須跨越可能移動的岩塊並錨入穩定岩體，才能提供有效拘束。錨力沿索軸傳遞，只有對抗位移方向的分量直接抗衡掉落；錨索角度也可能增加節理法向力而改變摩擦，但需要在自由體圖中明確計入。~Crown cables must cross the moving block and bond into stable rock to provide restraint. Force acts along the cable, and only its component opposing motion directly resists falling. Cable inclination may also increase joint normal force and friction, but that contribution must be represented explicitly in the free-body model. || 4支錨索各T=150 kN、與抗落方向夾角θ=30°，有效分力R=4Tcosθ=520 kN~For four cables each carrying T=150 kN at θ=30° to the resisting direction, R=4Tcosθ=520 kN || 核對鑽孔方向、錨碇段位置及張力紀錄，以載重試驗檢查錨固行為，再把實際角度帶入力平衡。~Verify bore direction, bond-zone position and force records, use load tests to assess anchorage, and insert actual angles into equilibrium. || 錨碇段仍位於可動楔塊內時，張拉成功不代表已把力傳入穩定岩體，可能整組一同移動。~A bond zone inside the moving wedge may tension successfully without transferring force into stable ground, allowing the whole assembly to move together. || 錨索總張力直接相加就是任意方向的支護力。~Adding cable tensions directly gives support resistance in every direction. || 竣工圖要標出自由段、錨碇段與節理面的相對位置；地工設計者確認錨定區穩定後才放行支護驗收。~As-built drawings show free and bond lengths relative to joints; the geotechnical designer confirms stable anchorage before support acceptance. || 分力總和未檢查群體作用、鋼材容量或長期損失，也不代表每支錨索均勻受力；應另核對變形相容與試驗證據。~The component sum omits group effects, steel resistance and long-term losses and does not prove equal cable loading; check deformation compatibility and test evidence separately.
噴凝土面板~Shotcrete panel || 噴凝土可束制小塊岩石並與錨桿形成局部面板系統，厚度、纖維殘餘強度及與岩面黏結共同影響其性能。面板平均壓力只能描述總荷載除以面積，不能說明孔邊沖切、薄弱處彎曲或早齡期承載是否足夠。~Shotcrete restrains small blocks and forms local panels with rock bolts; thickness, fibre residual strength and rock adhesion jointly govern performance. Average panel pressure is only total load divided by area and does not establish resistance to punching near bolts, bending at thin spots or loading at early age. || 假設局部岩塊荷重W=20 kN、分配面板面積A=4 m²，平均q=W/A=5 kPa~For local block load W=20 kN distributed over panel area A=4 m², mean q=W/A=5 kPa || 用厚度針、取芯及面板試驗核對厚度與韌性，檢查錨頭附近薄弱區；將材料齡期與實際加載時間配對。~Check thickness and toughness using depth pins, cores and panel tests, inspect thin zones near bolt heads, and match material age to actual loading time. || 表面平整但局部過薄或背後脫黏，會使面板突然剝落；只驗抗壓強度可能漏掉韌性不足。~A smooth surface can conceal thin spots or debonding that cause panel detachment; compressive strength alone may miss inadequate toughness. || 噴凝土表面看起來連續就具有均勻厚度與韌性。~A continuous-looking shotcrete surface has uniform thickness and toughness. || 檢驗計畫應把厚度、黏結及殘餘強度分列；未達指定齡期與試驗要求前，由支護設計者確認後續開挖限制。~The inspection plan separates thickness, bond and residual-strength evidence; the support designer confirms excavation restrictions until specified age and test requirements are satisfied. || 均布壓力並不代表真正局部荷載形狀，面板需依支點與岩塊接觸重新分析；本式不能取代噴凝土構件驗算。~Uniform pressure does not establish the actual contact pattern; panels require analysis with their supports and block contacts, and this expression cannot replace member checks.
應變換算~Strain conversion || 噴凝土或鋼構件的應變可反映支護開始參與承載的時間，但量測值包含溫度、收縮與儀器零點變化。用彈性模數換算應力前須先分離機械應變；早齡期模數及潛變不確定時，單一讀值無法唯一推回實際作用力。~Support strain can indicate when shotcrete or steel begins carrying load, but readings include temperature, shrinkage and zero drift. Separate mechanical strain before multiplying by modulus; uncertain early-age stiffness and creep mean one reading cannot uniquely recover the actual force carried by the support. || 假設已扣除溫度與收縮、E=20 GPa、機械應變ε=50 με=50×10⁻⁶，Δσ=Eε=1 MPa~After temperature and shrinkage correction, assume E=20 GPa and mechanical ε=50 με=50×10⁻⁶; Δσ=Eε=1 MPa || 成對配置應變與溫度感測器，保存安裝、歸零及開挖時間；用材料試驗模數檢查換算範圍。~Pair strain and temperature sensors, retain installation, zeroing and excavation times, and use tested moduli to bound stress conversion. || 把冷卻收縮全部當成荷載應變，會誤判支護超載；錯誤歸零也可能抹掉施工前已存在的應變。~Treating cooling contraction entirely as load strain can falsely indicate overload, while incorrect zeroing can erase strain that existed before later excavation. || 量到應變後乘上固定模數即可得到精確永久應力。~Measured strain times one constant modulus gives exact permanent stress. || 原始讀值與修正值須分開保存；感測器更換或歸零由監測負責人記錄，設計者審核其對基準連續性的影響。~Preserve raw and corrected readings separately; the monitoring lead records sensor replacement or rezeroing, and the designer reviews its effect on baseline continuity. || 線彈性式只適用於所取機械增量與相應模數，不能跨越開裂或大幅潛變狀態；零讀值也不代表構件沒有歷史荷載。~The elastic expression applies to the selected mechanical increment and corresponding modulus, not across cracking or major creep; a zero reading does not imply absence of historical load.
交叉口開口率~Intersection opening ratio || 支洞穿入大岩洞會切斷局部岩拱及支護連續性，使受力呈三維繞流。開口面積比例可用於列出幾何擾動程度，但開口位置比單一比例更重要；靠近拱腳或大型節理交會處的小開口，也可能導致顯著的應力轉移。~A branch cavern interrupts local rock arching and support continuity, forcing three-dimensional load redistribution. Opening-area ratio is useful for describing geometric disturbance, but location can matter more than the ratio: a small opening near an abutment or major joint intersection may cause substantial stress transfer. || 假設交叉開口Aopen=12 m²、參考牆面Aref=60 m²，幾何開口率r=Aopen/Aref=0.20~For opening area Aopen=12 m² and reference wall area Aref=60 m², geometric opening ratio r=Aopen/Aref=0.20 || 建立三維開口及節理模型，量測角隅收斂與支護應變；將分部開挖順序與反應峰值對時比較。~Model openings and joints in three dimensions, measure corner convergence and support strain, and align response peaks with staged excavation. || 把交叉口當成二維直線洞身會漏掉角隅應力與拱腳削弱，裂縫可能集中在支洞交會處。~Treating an intersection as a two-dimensional uniform tunnel misses corner stresses and weakened abutments, allowing damage to concentrate at the branch junction. || 開口率相同的兩個交叉口一定具有相同穩定性。~Two intersections with the same opening ratio have the same stability. || 交叉口應有獨立地質與支護剖面；設計者確認三維荷載轉移及分部開挖停留點後，才可套用洞身標準細部。~Provide dedicated geological and support sections at intersections; the designer verifies three-dimensional transfer and excavation hold points before standard tunnel details are adopted. || 開口率是無因次幾何指標，沒有直接的強度允收值；必須另查形狀、距離、支護連續性及交會角度。~Opening ratio is a dimensionless geometry descriptor without a direct strength acceptance limit; shape, spacing, support continuity and intersection angle require independent checks.
反算剛度~Back-calculated stiffness || 已知荷載與位移可反算等效剛度，用於檢查分析模型是否過軟或過硬，但不同的岩體參數、接縫滑移與支護剛度可能產生相似位移。只配合一個量測點會造成參數不可識別，必須用多位置與多階段反應限制合理解的範圍。~Known force and displacement can provide an equivalent stiffness for checking whether an analysis is too soft or stiff. Different rock parameters, joint slip and support stiffness can produce similar displacement, however. Fitting one point creates an identifiability problem; several locations and construction stages are needed to constrain plausible solutions. || 假設對應荷載增量ΔF=500 kN、位移增量Δu=5 mm，等效k=ΔF/Δu=100 kN/mm~For corresponding increments ΔF=500 kN and Δu=5 mm, equivalent stiffness k=ΔF/Δu=100 kN/mm || 以多支伸長計、收斂點及支護力共同反算，保留未用於配適的資料作驗證，檢查參數是否仍具物理意義。~Back-analyse extensometers, convergence and support forces together, retaining unused observations for validation and checking that fitted parameters remain physically meaningful. || 任意調整岩體模數直到位移吻合，可能掩蓋錯誤支承邊界，導致下一開挖階段預測失準。~Adjusting rock modulus until displacement matches can conceal incorrect support boundaries and produce poor predictions for the next excavation stage. || 模型配合一個監測點就證明所有地層參數正確。~Matching one monitoring point proves every ground parameter is correct. || 反算報告應列參數相關性、測值誤差及獨立驗證結果；變更支護前，由設計者審核而非以自動最佳配適放行。~Report parameter correlations, measurement error and independent validation; the designer reviews them before support changes rather than accepting an automatic best fit. || 此剛度屬特定階段與荷載路徑的等效值，不是岩石材料模數；若量測含剛體移動，須先移除其影響。~This is an equivalent stiffness for one stage and load path, not a rock material modulus; rigid-body movement must be separated before interpreting the measurement.
地震慣性~Seismic inertia || 地震可對穹頂楔塊施加附加慣性力，也會改變節理接觸與支護受力方向。擬靜力係數提供簡化水平力，但忽略波傳、相位及結構變形差異；地下工程不能只因埋置而假設沒有地震需求，尤其需要查節理與錨固區的相對變位。~Earthquakes add inertia to crown wedges and alter joint contact and support-force direction. A pseudo-static coefficient supplies a simplified horizontal force but omits wave propagation, phase and differential deformation. Burial alone does not eliminate seismic demand, particularly where joints and anchorage zones undergo relative movement. || 假設楔塊重量W=312 kN、水平擬靜力係數kh=0.15，Fh=khW=46.8 kN~For wedge weight W=312 kN and horizontal pseudo-static coefficient kh=0.15, Fh=khW=46.8 kN || 核對場址地震需求與楔塊可動方向，分別檢查不同加速度方向的自由體圖，必要時以動力分析驗證。~Check site seismic demand and admissible wedge movement, evaluate free bodies for different acceleration directions, and verify with dynamic analysis when required. || 地震使節理張開或錨索失去有效錨碇時，原有靜態安全餘裕可能消失，事件後局部落塊須重新調查。~Seismic joint opening or loss of effective anchorage can consume static margins; post-event local falls require renewed investigation of the support system. || 地下岩洞不受地表搖動，所以支護不用耐震檢查。~Underground caverns do not experience surface shaking, so support needs no seismic checks. || 交接計畫應列地震後需檢查的節理、錨頭與噴凝土區域；地工設計者確認受損機制後才核准重新開放。~Handover identifies joints, anchor heads and shotcrete zones for post-earthquake inspection; the geotechnical designer confirms damage mechanisms before reopening is approved. || 擬靜力係數不是任意選用的通用常數，且此單一水平力不包含垂直作用或波傳應變；應按專案地震分析基準選擇。~The pseudo-static coefficient is not a universal arbitrary constant, and this horizontal force excludes vertical action and wave strain; select it under the project's seismic-analysis basis.
排水與接觸力~Drainage and contact force || 岩洞節理中的水壓會減少有效法向接觸，降低摩擦可動員程度；排水系統因此是支護性能的一部分。時間久後的沉積或結垢可使局部水壓恢復，外觀乾燥並不能證明深部節理無壓，維護應把水頭變化與支護反應一起追蹤。~Water pressure in joints reduces effective normal contact and available friction, making drainage part of support performance. Sediment or mineral buildup can restore local water pressure with time. A dry visible surface does not establish unpressurized deeper joints, so maintenance must track hydraulic head together with support response. || 法向總力N=500 kN、均勻節理水壓u=100 kPa、面積A=2 m²，N′=N−uA=300 kN~With total normal force N=500 kN, uniform joint pressure u=100 kPa and area A=2 m², N′=N−uA=300 kN || 將排水流量、水壓計與節理開合量對時比對，檢查低流量是否代表缺水或堵塞，保留清理前後資料。~Compare drain flow, piezometers and joint opening on one clock, distinguishing low inflow from blockage and retaining evidence before and after cleaning. || 排水堵塞可能使摩擦力下降而表面流量變小；若誤以為滲水改善，會錯過接觸力衰減的訊號。~Blocked drainage may reduce friction while visible flow decreases; interpreting reduced seepage as improvement can miss the loss of effective contact force. || 排水量減少一定表示岩洞變得更乾燥且更穩定。~Lower drain flow always means a drier and more stable cavern. || 維護資料須記各排水孔的集水區與通達性；清理或封孔前，由地工及營運負責人核定對接觸力的影響。~Maintenance records identify each drain's catchment and access; geotechnical and operations leads approve the effect on contact force before cleaning or sealing drains. || 本式假設均勻水壓與有效接觸面積，部分張開節理需重新界定面積；若計算負值，不能把摩擦抗力當成負值繼續套用。~The expression assumes uniform pressure and a defined contact area; partly open joints require revised area, and a negative result cannot be carried forward as negative friction resistance.
'''),'原創教學例：假設穹頂可動楔塊體積V=12 m³，岩石單位重γ=26 kN/m³，重量W=γV=312 kN。若地質測繪使估計體積增加10%至13.2 m³，重量增為343.2 kN，增加31.2 kN。這個結果只修改重力項，不表示所需錨力也一定按相同比例增加，因為楔塊形狀改變可能同時影響節理接觸面、出露方向與錨索穿越位置。必須重新建立三維自由體圖，檢查水壓、摩擦及錨固，再用獨立地質觀測確認模型。~Original teaching example: assume a potentially movable crown wedge of V=12 m³ and rock unit weight γ=26 kN/m³. Its weight is W=γV=312 kN. If mapping increases the estimated volume by 10% to 13.2 m³, weight becomes 343.2 kN, an increase of 31.2 kN. This changes gravity only; required cable force need not increase by the same percentage because revised geometry may also change joint contact area, daylighting direction and cable intersections. Rebuild the three-dimensional free body, check water pressure, friction and anchorage, and corroborate the geometry with independent geological observations.',['geo-cavern','usace-rock','geo-site'],['裕廊岩洞：大型岩洞系統比較~Jurong Rock Caverns: large-cavern comparison','赤柱污水處理廠岩洞：用途比較~Stanley sewage-treatment caverns: functional comparison'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
